{
  "id": "unique-event-041",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#41 - Eliza’s Forest\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1207,1228]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Now you know Eliza’s story, at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1228,1259]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "least in part. You need to gather 4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1259,1295]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Clues to find the exact location of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1295,1331]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the forest where she found her\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1331,1362]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "book. Prepare a separate map\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1362,1391]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "diagram. This will represent a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1391,1422]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "forest just out of town. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1422,1455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "search every box until you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1455,1487]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gathered 4 clues. If you already\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1487,1520]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have 4 Clues, you will find the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1520,1552]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "location in the first box you visit.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1552,1589]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "In the unlikely event that you fail\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1589,1625]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "all the Search rolls, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1625,1656]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically find the location in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1656,1691]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the last box on the map.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1691,1716]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "On each roll of a 1 on any Search\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1716,1750]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll, you will have an encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1750,1784]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Roll d6. On a 1-4, roll on the Beast\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1784,1821]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table. On a 5-6, roll on the Witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1821,1856]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Children table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1856,1872]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you find the location, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1872,1904]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find a clearing with a tree stump\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1904,1938]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turned into an unholy altar. There\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1938,1973]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are remains of wax candles, magic",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1973,2006]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "symbols and unidentifiable\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,22,49]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bones scattered around. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,49,80]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "did not have any encounter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,80,107]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "during your trip in the forest, a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,107,141]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "random encounter from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,141,167]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demonic Horror table will be\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,167,196]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "waiting for you here. If you had\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,196,229]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any encounter, no demon will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,229,258]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wait for you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,258,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "After the battle, if any, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,272,306]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "make a L6 Magic roll. Add +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,306,338]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have Occultism, +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,338,368]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have Occultism (Expert). If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,368,400]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fail, nothing happens. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,400,430]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "succeed, you gain a permanent\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,430,460]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 to all rolls against Witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,460,490]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Children, Witches or Demons\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,490,518]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "until the end of the campaign.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,518,549]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This bonus applies to all Attack,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,549,583]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense rolls and to all saves,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,583,615]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and also to all attempts to close\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,615,649]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hell gates.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,649,661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Armed with your newly acquired\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,661,692]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "occult knowledge, you may now\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,692,722]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "return to the exploration of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,722,755]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "town.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,755,761]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-041:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Eliza Dunforth",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[95,761,775]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    94,
    95
  ]
}
